.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-tag\-protection\-list \- List protected tag rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli tag protection list [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&List protected tag rules
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output protected tag rules as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-L, \-\-limit <int>\fR
\&Maximum number of protected tag rules to list
\&Default: \(dq30\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli tag protection list owner/repo \-\-limit 50
.fi
